<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>How does your visa type change what a lender will do?</h2>
    <p>Lenders set their own rules, and they change. As a rough guide:</p>

    <div class="table-wrap visa-compare-wrap">
      <table class="visa-compare">
        <thead>
          <tr>
